# This file lists the keys of the values that the app reads, each under a
# comment that says what goes there. After a clone, copy it to .env and fill
# in the values there; .env stays out of git. Every value ends up in the app,
# where anyone can read it, so never put a secret into one. An empty value
# counts as missing.
#
# Write a value as it is, or in double quotes if it has a space, a # or a quote.
{{{env_keys}}}
